# Before writing or changing music, read music/README.md (style, moods, format).
# Built after the title song (music/title.scrim). E Phrygian dominant (the title's A minor with its
# G#, on E), the oboe opening on the toy tune (E F G# B A), harp, a choir drone on E; the last call
# narrows.
title    Ruins
composer Claude
about    Sandstone halls and a sunken cenote, after the glass bird: an oboe in E Phrygian dominant (the title's notes with its G#, on E) opening on the toy tune (E F G#, B A, G#), harp arpeggios, a low choir holding E under everything, glass harmonica chords and a low fretless bass; the bird calls at the phrase ends, the last call narrowed to a half step. When something is near, a cracked crystal ostinato ticks over a glass heartbeat, a frame drum and a rim; a kit and the tune come back as it comes for you, a horn, drive and breaking glass for a fight, choir and gong for a guardian.
tempo    70
beats    4
steps    4
reverb   0.45

# moods (music/README.md)
# mood explore:  lead drone ost pad bass bird
# mood treasure: ost pad bird wonder
# mood sense:    crack heart bodhran rim pad bass bowl
# mood rise:     sense -bowl lead kick snare
# mood fight:    rise -heart -rim horn drive war smash
# mood boss:     fight -lead choir gong

voice lead     oboe       vol=0.55 pan=-0.1 rev=0.45
voice drone    voices     vol=0.24 pan=0.1  att=1.2 rel=1.6
voice ost      harp       vol=0.48 pan=0.25
voice pad      glassharp  vol=0.2  pan=-0.25 center=A3 att=0.4 rel=0.8
voice bass     fretless   vol=0.7  glide=0.08
voice bird     crystal    vol=0.5  pan=0.4  rev=0.7
voice wonder   crystal    vol=0.28 pan=-0.35 rev=0.6
voice crack    crystal    vol=0.4  pan=-0.3
voice heart    glasstap   vol=0.3  pan=0.1
voice bodhran  bodhran    vol=0.48 pan=-0.2
voice rim      rim        vol=0.3  pan=0.3
voice bowl     bowl       vol=0.28 pan=0.15 rev=0.6
voice kick     kick       vol=0.5
voice snare    snare      vol=0.36 pan=0.1
voice horn     horn       vol=0.7  pan=0.2  oct=-1 att=0.025 rel=0.12 rev=0.3
voice drive    pizz       vol=0.55 pan=-0.35 gate=0.55 rev=0.25
voice war      tommid     vol=0.5  pan=0.15 rev=0.2
voice smash    shatter    vol=0.35 pan=-0.2
voice choir    voices     vol=0.28 center=D3 att=0.5 rel=0.8
voice gong     gong       vol=0.3  pan=-0.3

